Z||000000||RossT||10-29-2001||08:12 PM||||I was snooping around my engine compartment today and found the green wire (cut) on the 5-speed getrag.  It runs next to a blue wire (intact) into a clip that mounts on the getrag.  The 2 wires come out of this clip and go further up then into to the trany?<P>Car seems to be fine with this green wire cut?  What is it for? and should I splice it back whats remaining of the green wire into the clip?  <P>Thanks?<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image016_3.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image014_3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
